# ── Shipped sample data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# test_data/ ships with the repo so the GUI works out of the box. Re-include its
# data files despite the global *.tif/*.h5/... ignores above (order matters — these
# negations come last). Generated outputs and scratch files stay ignored.
!test_data/**/*.tif
!test_data/**/*.tiff
!test_data/**/*.h5
!test_data/**/*.hdf5
!test_data/**/*.json
!test_data/**/*.csv
!test_data/**/*.txt
!test_data/**/*.py
!test_data/**/*.png
test_data/output/
test_data/out_temp.txt
